	<span class=\"UnderlineText\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://theimprovcentre.ca/mid-season-pass/\">Become a Mid Season Pass Holder &amp; Save on this show!</a></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h1>Friday & Saturday evenings</h1><span><br/></span>Two teams of highly skilled improv comedians vie for the laughs and support of audience judges. A high-energy, fast-paced, and good-natured competition that will leave you wanting more! <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>It’s Vancouver’s longest running show for over 45 years, so you can bet the comedy in this show is top notch!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Run time: 90 minutes including intermission<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Rated: 🌶️🌶️🌶️ – Best for teens and up.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Please Note: as The Improv Centre is a licensed facility, all minors (persons under the age of 19) must be accompanied by an adult.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>All physical vouchers must now be redeemed via phone or email. Please contact the box office for assistance.
""";
